  "body_html": "<p>Mariscal: tu Cuadrilla cuenta por defecto con media docena de miembros. Trátalos como un seguidor con la etiqueta <em>grupo</em> . Todos los valores iniciales de esta hoja pueden cambiar durante el juego.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">La Cuadrilla</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP máx.\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP máx.</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Armadura\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Armadura</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Daño\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Tirar daño\">Daño</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">Los HP empiezan en 6 cada uno; la Armadura en 0; el Daño en d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Etiquetas</h3>\n<p>Tu cuadrilla empieza con <em>grupo</em>, una etiqueta que otorga tu trasfondo, más otras 2 a tu elección.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>arqueros</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>atléticos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>valientes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>astutos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>devotos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Empieza marcada\"> <span><em>grupo</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>curtidos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>intimidantes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>observadores</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>pacientes</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>respetados</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>sigilosos</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>guerreros</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escribe aquí\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escribe aquí\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escribe aquí\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>excepcionales</em> (requiere Héroes hasta el Final)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinto</h3>\n<p>Elige 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Discutir, pelearse entre ellos y guardar rencores</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>Aferrarse a la tradición y la superstición</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Ceder a sus instintos más bajos</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Avasallar a los demás</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Correr riesgos innecesarios</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Llevar las cosas demasiado lejos</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escribe aquí\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Coste</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Elige 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lealtad</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lealtad 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lealtad 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lealtad 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Juergas, en grupo</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Reconocimiento público y respeto, honor</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Riesgos corridos, por ti, para ayudarlos</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Victorias logradas contra enemigos dignos</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Riquezas ganadas para ellos o para Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"escribe aquí\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inventario</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ o menos es carga ligera; 4–6 ◇ es carga normal; 7–9 ◇ es carga pesada.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Hacha pequeña</strong>, de hierro (<em>mano</em>, <em>arrojadiza</em>, x perforante)</li><li>◇ <strong>Lanza</strong>, de hierro (<em>cerca</em>, <em>arrojadiza</em>, x perforante)</li><li>◇ <strong>Arco y flechas de hierro</strong> (<em>próximo</em>, x perforante, ○ poca munición, ○ agotada)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Escudo</strong> (+1 armadura, +1 Preparación con 7+ al Defender)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Pieles gruesas</strong> (1 armadura, <em>abrigado</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Capa</strong> (<em>abrigado</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Suministros</strong> (4+Prosperidad usos por miembro de la cuadrilla)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Suministros</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Uso 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Uso 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Uso 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Uso 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Uso 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Uso 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Uso 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Uso 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Uso 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Uso 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Uso 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Uso 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Uso 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Uso 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Uso 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Uso 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Otro equipo</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Individuos</h3>\n<p>Cuando alguien destaque, dale un nombre, una etiqueta y uno o más rasgos.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiqueta</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"etiqueta\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Rasgos</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"rasgos\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiqueta</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"etiqueta\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Rasgos</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"rasgos\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiqueta</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"etiqueta\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Rasgos</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"rasgos\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiqueta</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"etiqueta\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Rasgos</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"rasgos\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiqueta</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"etiqueta\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Rasgos</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"rasgos\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiqueta</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"etiqueta\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Rasgos</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"rasgos\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Nombres:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Etiquetas:</strong> <em>amante de los animales, grandullón, matón, cínico, borracho, entusiasta, jugador, codicioso, gruñón, crédulo, rompecorazones, honesto, amable, procaz, menudo, ingenuo, viejo, popular, orgulloso, novato, temerario, sinvergüenza, ojos de lince, de mecha corta</em></p>\n<p><strong>Rasgos:</strong> hijo/hermano/padre/primo/___ de ___, calvo, enamorado de ___, rencor contra ___, odia a ___, idolatra a ___, bromista, desastrado, le falta un ojo/dedo/mano/___, echa de menos a sus hijos, pesadillas, recién casado, religioso, cicatrices, esmirriado, lengua afilada, canta, ronca, cuenta batallitas, demasiado serio, problemas en casa, silba, talla madera</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notas</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notas\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Ordenar a los Seguidores</h3>\n<p>Cuando <strong><em>les indicas que hagan un movimiento y lo hacen</em></strong>, tira +1 en vez de +ESTADÍSTICA si aplica alguna de sus etiquetas (o +2 si además son <em>excepcionales</em>). Si no aplica ninguna etiqueta, tira +0. Si alguna de sus etiquetas estorbara, tira con desventaja.</p>\n<p>Cuando están <strong><em>sin órdenes</em></strong> o <strong><em>actúan por iniciativa propia</em></strong>, el DJ dice qué hacen y cómo les va.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Fortalece el Vínculo</h3>\n<p>Cuando <strong><em>pagas su coste</em></strong> y no lo has hecho hace poco, guardan +1 de Lealtad (máx. 3).</p>\n<p>Gasta su Lealtad 1 a 1 para que:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Venzan su miedo y hagan lo que dices</li><li>Se resistan a actuar según su instinto/etiquetas/rasgos</li><li>Hagan algo que no quieren hacer (siempre que no sea aberrante ni suicida)</li></ul>"
}
